  "$comment": "DevRites keeps the root orchestration context source-read-only by instruction; no permission mode enforces it. These allow rules cover the engine, read-only git, the codebase-memory-mcp code index and .devrites/ workspace edits. Native subagents own specialist execution; only devrites-slice-wright may edit source in the lifecycle (fast-builder writes for /rite-fast; overhaul-* agents keep every tool). Its task lists exact project-relative paths, and the root rejects any returned diff outside that contract.",
